id: SAVE5-4
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: reload_after_control
target: crates/core/src/confirm.rs
find:     state.run.current = Some(to.clone());
replace:     let _ = &to;
expect-fail: reload_right_after_confirm_burst_keeps_one_achievement
note: 確認の達成で次の Step へ現在位置を移さない。連打の 2 回目以降が達成済みの Step に届き、達成が重複する
